# tof_recover_landing_invalid.expect — samples return during the blind landing, all invalid
# ToF なしの着陸の最中にサンプルが戻るが全部無効
#
# Falsification: the same run on main as of 2026-11-08 ends the episode ~1 s after the samples return
# (no "only invalid samples while flying" episode in the log) because an invalid sample in LANDING counted as agreement.
# 反証: main（2026-11-08 時点）で同じ実行をすると、LANDING の無効サンプルが一致と数えられるので、サンプルが戻った約 1 s 後に
# エピソードが終わる（ログに "only invalid samples while flying" のエピソードが出ない）。
exit 0
log_contains any "Downward ToF silent (>= 300 ms without a sample) in FLYING/ALT_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silence episode: only invalid samples while flying"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
order "Blind landing: ToF silent" "Downward ToF silence episode: only invalid samples while flying"
order "Downward ToF silence episode: only invalid samples while flying" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
metric descent_speed_max < 0.8 in 14.0 21.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 18.0 22.0
